  "extract_html": "<div class=\"mw-content-ltr mw-parser-output\" lang=\"en\" dir=\"ltr\"><div class=\"ib-wrap\" style=\"width:340px\">\n   \n<aside role=\"region\" class=\"portable-infobox pi-background pi-border-color pi-theme-plum pi-layout-default\">\n<h2 class=\"pi-item pi-item-spacing pi-title pi-secondary-background\" data-source=\"Box title\">Chemical Absorption</h2>\n\n<figure class=\"pi-item pi-image\" data-source=\"image\">\n\t<a href=\"https://static.wikia.nocookie.net/powerlisting/images/b/bb/Agony_Symbiote.jpg/revision/latest?cb=20120327202029\" class=\"image image-thumbnail\" title=\"Agony Symbiote\">\n\t\t<img src=\"https://static.wikia.nocookie.net/powerlisting/images/b/bb/Agony_Symbiote.jpg/revision/latest/scale-to-width-down/350?cb=20120327202029\" srcset=\"https://static.wikia.nocookie.net/powerlisting/images/b/bb/Agony_Symbiote.jpg/revision/latest/scale-to-width-down/350?cb=20120327202029 1x, https://static.wikia.nocookie.net/powerlisting/images/b/bb/Agony_Symbiote.jpg/revision/latest?cb=20120327202029 2x\" class=\"pi-image-thumbnail\" data-relevant=\"1\" alt=\"Agony Symbiote\" width=\"270\" height=\"242\" data-image-key=\"Agony_Symbiote.jpg\" data-image-name=\"Agony Symbiote.jpg\" />\n\t\t\n\t</a>\n\t\n</figure>\n<h2 class=\"pi-item pi-header pi-secondary-font pi-item-spacing pi-secondary-background\">Agony's (Marvel Comics) symbiotic suit absorbs chemicals, including Spider-Man's synthetic webbing.</h2>\n\n<div class=\"pi-item pi-data pi-item-spacing pi-border-color\" data-source=\"Row 1 info\">\n\t\n\t\t<h3 class=\"pi-data-label pi-secondary-font\">Power/Ability to:</h3>\n\t\n\t<div class=\"pi-data-value pi-font\">Absorb chemicals.</div>\n</div>\n</aside>\n</div>\n<p>The power to <b>absorb chemicals and utilize them in some way</b>. Sub-power of <a href=\"/wiki/Chemistry_Manipulation\" title=\"Chemistry Manipulation\">Chemistry Manipulation</a>. Variation of <a href=\"/wiki/Absorption\" title=\"Absorption\">Absorption</a>.\n</p>\n<div id=\"toc\" class=\"toc\" role=\"navigation\" aria-labelledby=\"mw-toc-heading\"><input type=\"checkbox\" role=\"button\" id=\"toctogglecheckbox\" class=\"toctogglecheckbox\" style=\"display:none\" /><div class=\"toctitle\" lang=\"en\" dir=\"ltr\"><h2 id=\"mw-toc-heading\">Contents</h2><span class=\"toctogglespan\"><label class=\"toctogglelabel\" for=\"toctogglecheckbox\"></label></span></div>\n<ul>\n<li class=\"toclevel-1 tocsection-1\"><a href=\"#Capabilities\"><span class=\"tocnumber\">1</span> <span class=\"toctext\">Capabilities</span></a></li>\n<li class=\"toclevel-1 tocsection-2\"><a href=\"#Applications\"><span class=\"tocnumber\">2</span> <span class=\"toctext\">Applications</span></a></li>\n<li class=\"toclevel-1 tocsection-3\"><a href=\"#Associations\"><span class=\"tocnumber\">3</span> <span class=\"toctext\">Associations</span></a></li>\n<li class=\"toclevel-1 tocsection-4\"><a href=\"#Limitations\"><span class=\"tocnumber\">4</span> <span class=\"toctext\">Limitations</span></a></li>\n<li class=\"toclevel-1 tocsection-5\"><a href=\"#Known_Users\"><span class=\"tocnumber\">5</span> <span class=\"toctext\">Known Users</span></a></li>\n<li class=\"toclevel-1 tocsection-6\"><a href=\"#Known_Objects\"><span class=\"tocnumber\">6</span> <span class=\"toctext\">Known Objects</span></a></li>\n<li class=\"toclevel-1 tocsection-7\"><a href=\"#Gallery\"><span class=\"tocnumber\">7</span> <span class=\"toctext\">Gallery</span></a></li>\n<li class=\"toclevel-1 tocsection-8\"><a href=\"#Videos\"><span class=\"tocnumber\">8</span> <span class=\"toctext\">Videos</span></a></li>\n</ul>\n</div>\n\n<h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Capabilities\">Capabilities</span><span class=\"mw-editsection\"><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">[</span><a title=\"Sign in to edit\" class=\"mw-editsection-visualeditor\" data-tracking-label=\"log-in-edit-section\" data-action=\"edit-section\" href=\"https://auth.fandom.com/signin?redirect=https%3A%2F%2Fpowerlisting.fandom.com%2Fwiki%2FChemical_Absorption%3Fveaction%3Dedit%26section%3D1&amp;uselang=en&amp;metadata=article-registration-edit-article-section\" data-testid=\"log-in-edit-section\" aria-label=\"Sign in to edit\"><svg class=\"wds-icon wds-icon-tiny\" aria-hidden=\"true\" focusable=\"false\"><use xlink:href=\"#wds-icons-pencil-tiny\"></use></svg></a><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">]</span></span></h2>\n<p>The user can absorb chemicals while removing them from the source, into their body and use it in various ways, gaining some form of advantage, either by enhancing themselves, gaining the drained power, using it as power source etc., either temporarily or permanently.\n</p>\n<h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Applications\">Applications</span><span class=\"mw-editsection\"><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">[</span><a title=\"Sign in to edit\" class=\"mw-editsection-visualeditor\" data-tracking-label=\"log-in-edit-section\" data-action=\"edit-section\" href=\"https://auth.fandom.com/signin?redirect=https%3A%2F%2Fpowerlisting.fandom.com%2Fwiki%2FChemical_Absorption%3Fveaction%3Dedit%26section%3D2&amp;uselang=en&amp;metadata=article-registration-edit-article-section\" data-testid=\"log-in-edit-section\" aria-label=\"Sign in to edit\"><svg class=\"wds-icon wds-icon-tiny\" aria-hidden=\"true\" focusable=\"false\"><use xlink:href=\"#wds-icons-pencil-tiny\"></use></svg></a><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">]</span></span></h2>\n<ul><li><a href=\"/wiki/Affinity\" class=\"mw-redirect\" title=\"Affinity\">Affinity</a></li>\n<li><a href=\"/wiki/Body_Storage\" title=\"Body Storage\">Body Storage</a></li>\n<li><a href=\"/wiki/Chemical_Repository\" title=\"Chemical Repository\">Chemical Repository</a>\n<ul><li><a href=\"/wiki/Assimilation_Shield\" class=\"mw-redirect\" title=\"Assimilation Shield\">Assimilation Shield</a></li>\n<li><a href=\"/wiki/Biochemical_Mixture\" title=\"Biochemical Mixture\">Biochemical Mixture</a></li>\n<li><a href=\"/wiki/Memory_Condition\" title=\"Memory Condition\">Memory Condition</a>\n<ul><li><a href=\"/wiki/Power_Retention\" title=\"Power Retention\">Power Retention</a>/<a href=\"/wiki/Power_Residuum\" title=\"Power Residuum\">Residuum</a></li></ul></li>\n<li><a href=\"/wiki/Property_Absorption\" title=\"Property Absorption\">Property Absorption</a></li></ul></li>\n<li><a href=\"/wiki/Enhanced_Condition\" class=\"mw-redirect\" title=\"Enhanced Condition\">Enhanced Condition</a>/<a href=\"/wiki/Supernatural_Condition\" class=\"mw-redirect\" title=\"Supernatural Condition\">Supernatural Condition</a></li>\n<li><a href=\"/wiki/Molecular_Structure_Absorption\" title=\"Molecular Structure Absorption\">Molecular Structure Absorption</a>\n<ul><li><a href=\"/wiki/Mimetic_Regeneration\" title=\"Mimetic Regeneration\">Mimetic Regeneration</a>\n<ul><li><a href=\"/wiki/Absorbing_Regeneration\" title=\"Absorbing Regeneration\">Absorbing Regeneration</a></li></ul></li></ul></li>\n<li><a href=\"/wiki/Power_Absorption\" class=\"mw-redirect\" title=\"Power Absorption\">Power Absorption</a> (limited to chemical-based powers)</li></ul>\n<h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Associations\">Associations</span><span class=\"mw-editsection\"><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">[</span><a title=\"Sign in to edit\" class=\"mw-editsection-visualeditor\" data-tracking-label=\"log-in-edit-section\" data-action=\"edit-section\" href=\"https://auth.fandom.com/signin?redirect=https%3A%2F%2Fpowerlisting.fandom.com%2Fwiki%2FChemical_Absorption%3Fveaction%3Dedit%26section%3D3&amp;uselang=en&amp;metadata=article-registration-edit-article-section\" data-testid=\"log-in-edit-section\" aria-label=\"Sign in to edit\"><svg class=\"wds-icon wds-icon-tiny\" aria-hidden=\"true\" focusable=\"false\"><use xlink:href=\"#wds-icons-pencil-tiny\"></use></svg></a><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">]</span></span></h2>\n<ul><li><a href=\"/wiki/Absorption\" title=\"Absorption\">Absorption</a></li>\n<li><a href=\"/wiki/Body_Chemistry_Manipulation\" title=\"Body Chemistry Manipulation\">Body Chemistry Manipulation</a></li>\n<li><a href=\"/wiki/Drug_Usage\" class=\"mw-redirect\" title=\"Drug Usage\">Drug Usage</a></li>\n<li><a href=\"/wiki/Pollution_Manipulation\" title=\"Pollution Manipulation\">Pollution Manipulation</a>\n<ul><li><a href=\"/wiki/Poison_Generation\" title=\"Poison Generation\">Poison Generation</a></li></ul></li>\n<li><a href=\"/wiki/Radiation_Manipulation\" title=\"Radiation Manipulation\">Radiation Manipulation</a></li></ul>\n<h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Limitations\">Limitations</span><span class=\"mw-editsection\"><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">[</span><a title=\"Sign in to edit\" class=\"mw-editsection-visualeditor\" data-tracking-label=\"log-in-edit-section\" data-action=\"edit-section\" href=\"https://auth.fandom.com/signin?redirect=https%3A%2F%2Fpowerlisting.fandom.com%2Fwiki%2FChemical_Absorption%3Fveaction%3Dedit%26section%3D4&amp;uselang=en&amp;metadata=article-registration-edit-article-section\" data-testid=\"log-in-edit-section\" aria-label=\"Sign in to edit\"><svg class=\"wds-icon wds-icon-tiny\" aria-hidden=\"true\" focusable=\"false\"><use xlink:href=\"#wds-icons-pencil-tiny\"></use></svg></a><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">]</span></span></h2>\n<ul><li>May only be able to absorb certain kinds of chemicals.</li>\n<li>May only be able to absorb a limited amount of said chemicals.</li>\n<li><a href=\"/wiki/Absorption_Immunity\" class=\"mw-redirect\" title=\"Absorption Immunity\">Absorption Immunity</a>/<a href=\"/wiki/Absorption_Negation\" title=\"Absorption Negation\">Absorption Negation</a></li></ul>\n<h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Known_Users\">Known Users</span><span class=\"mw-editsection\"><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">[</span><a title=\"Sign in to edit\" class=\"mw-editsection-visualeditor\" data-tracking-label=\"log-in-edit-section\" data-action=\"edit-section\" href=\"https://auth.fandom.com/signin?redirect=https%3A%2F%2Fpowerlisting.fandom.com%2Fwiki%2FChemical_Absorption%3Fveaction%3Dedit%26section%3D5&amp;uselang=en&amp;metadata=article-registration-edit-article-section\" data-testid=\"log-in-edit-section\" aria-label=\"Sign in to edit\"><svg class=\"wds-icon wds-icon-tiny\" aria-hidden=\"true\" focusable=\"false\"><use xlink:href=\"#wds-icons-pencil-tiny\"></use></svg></a><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">]</span></span></h2>\n<div class=\"scrollable\" style=\"overflow:auto; max-height:275px; width:100%; -moz-border-radius-topleft:0.5em; border:1px solid #AAAAAA; padding-left:0.5em; background:transparent;\">\n<ul><li>Hulk (<i>Marvel Comics</i>)</li>\n<li>Carmilla Black (<i>Marvel Comics</i>)</li>\n<li>Radioactive Man (<i>Marvel Comics</i>)</li>\n<li>The Host (<i>Marvel Comics</i>)</li>\n<li>Michael Boone (<i>Marvel Comics/House of M</i>)</li>\n<li>She-Hulk (<i>Marvel Comics</i>)</li>\n<li>Absorbing Man (<i>Marvel Comics</i>)</li>\n<li>Spore (<i>Marvel Comics</i>)</li>\n<li>Plasmus (<i>DC Comics</i>)</li>\n<li>Poison Ivy (<i>DC Comics</i>)</li>\n<li>Joker (<i>DC Comics</i>)</li>\n<li>Swamp Thing (<i>DC Comics</i>)</li>\n<li>Clayface (<i>DC Comics</i>)</li>\n<li>Bane (<i>DC Comics</i>)</li>\n<li>Dr. Rockso (<i>Metalocalypse</i>)</li>\n<li>Various Poison-type Pokemon (<i>Pokemon</i>)</li>\n<li>Vapor Man (<i>Birdman and the Galaxy Trio</i>)</li>\n<li>Kidomaru (<i>Naruto</i>)</li>\n<li>Toxic Avenger (<i>The Toxic Avenger</i>)</li>\n<li>Godzilla (<i>Godzilla</i>)</li>\n<li>Hedorah (<i>Godzilla</i>); absorbs toxic chemicals</li>\n<li>Father (<i>Fullmetal Alchemist</i>)</li>\n<li>Albert Wesker (<i>Resident Evil Series</i>)</li>\n<li>Alejandro Herrera (<i>Heroes</i>)</li>\n<li>Captain Pollution (<i>Captain Planet</i>)</li>\n<li>Megatox (<i>Sonic the Comic</i>)</li>\n<li>Black Terror (<i>The Black Terror</i>)</li>\n<li>Karl Ruprecht Kroenen (<i>Hellboy</i>/<i>BRPD</i>)</li>\n<li>Ceaser Clown (<i>One Piece</i>)</li></ul>\n</div>\n<h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Known_Objects\">Known Objects</span><span cla